<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>GoProZero — Product Sustainability KPI System</title>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  EDITING THIS FILE  ·  tools/templates/kpi_manual_itsowl.html.template
  ============================================================================
  it's OWL EDITION of the KPI-system visual manual — a corporate-technical
  re-skin styled after its-owl.de, with a SWITCHABLE light/dark theme AND a
  switchable EN/DE language (both are nav toggles; each choice is remembered in
  localStorage and applied before first paint, from the OS/browser preference).
  The it's OWL signature red is the brand accent on pill controls, links and
  steps; the composite "Sustainability" score is a sustainability green
  (distinct from the Environmental Impact domain).

  This is a TEMPLATE: the build script injects the KPI catalog JSON into the
  single catalog-JSON marker (the empty script#catalog block near the bottom)
  and writes output/kpi-system-manual-itsowl.html. Rebuild after any catalog
  edit:

      uv run tools/scripts/build_visualization.py \
          --template tools/templates/kpi_manual_itsowl.html.template \
          --out output/kpi-system-manual-itsowl.html

  LOCALIZATION SCOPE: the UI chrome, the authored manual prose (data-i18n keys
  + the PROSE/UI/… dictionaries in the script), and authored JS content
  (strategies, R-principles, life-cycle codes, the 22-column reference, and the
  5 domain names/descriptions) are bilingual. Catalog-derived text (indicator
  names/descriptions/objectives and the standards bibliography) stays in its
  source language — translating it is a separate workbook-level task.

  It shares the SAME catalog as the other templates; the JS here is the
  localized, re-renderable variant. Swap in official logo artwork by editing
  the .brand block (the wordmark inverts with the theme).
  ============================================================================
-->
