    <h2 data-i18n="gl.h2">Glossary</h2>
    <div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:16px">
      <div>
        <h3 data-i18n="gl.h3r">R-principles (R0–R9): the circular-economy hierarchy</h3>
        <div class="tablewrap"><table id="rTable"><thead><tr><th data-i18n="th.code">Code</th><th data-i18n="th.principle">Principle</th><th data-i18n="th.meaning">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 data-i18n="gl.h3plc">Product Life-Cycle (PLC) stage codes</h3>
        <div class="tablewrap"><table id="plcTable"><thead><tr><th data-i18n="th.code">Code</th><th data-i18n="th.stage">Stage</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
        <h3 data-i18n="gl.h3method">Method terms</h3>
        <div class="card" data-i18n="gl.method">
          <p style="margin-bottom:8px"><b>Normalized</b>: min-max scaling onto 0–1. Whichever bound is larger sets the direction.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:8px"><b>Inflow / Outflow</b>: quantity entering or leaving the process scope.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:8px"><b>LCA</b>: Life Cycle Assessment, a common data source (OpenLCA, GaBi).</p>
          <p><b>LCC</b>: Life Cycle Costing, the data source for monetary data.</p>
        </div>
